@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### Create user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Silva",
  "email": "blice2@example.com"
}

### Create second user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bob Santos",
  "email": "bob@example.com"
}

### Get user by ID (replace with real ID after creation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/773d135f-0682-4b75-af96-6aeb4b42cc1a

### List users (no filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### List users — filter by name (contains)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filters={"name:contains":"alice"}

### List users — filter by email (exact)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filters={"email:equals":"bob@example.com"}

### List users — order by name ASC
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?orderBy="email:desc"

### List users — order by createdAt DESC + pagination (page 1, limit 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?orderBy=["createdAt:desc"]&pagination={"page":1,"limit":2}

### Filter + order + pagination combined
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?filters={"name:contains":"a"}&orderBy=["name:asc"]&pagination={"page":1,"limit":3}

### Full-text search by name/email
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?search=blice2@example.com

### Update user name (replace ID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/773d135f-0682-4b75-af96-6aeb4b42cc1a/name
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tarcisio Andrade"
}
